ok","phenax","iretis","leonin"],"location":"theros","importance":"major","page":"wiki/ashiok","order":701,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":10,"quote":"they made a bargain with Phenax , the god of lies and deceit","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok#:~:text=they%20made%20a%20bargain,of%20lies%20and%20deceit","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Ashiok","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok#:~:text=they%20made%20a%20bargain,of%20lies%20and%20deceit","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Ashiok\", section \"Theros\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"ashiok-e2","summary":"Posing as Udaen, Ashiok sends nightmare abominations to kill people at a peace meeting; the leonin annihilate Iretis, serving Phenax's plan, and Ashiok asks to be made invisible to the gods.","participants":["ashiok","kedarick-vi","leonin","phenax","iretis","returned"],"location":"iretis","importance":"major","page":"wiki/ashiok","order":701,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":11,"quote":"The leonin retaliated by annihilating the Iretis' citizenry","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok#:~:text=The%20leonin%20retaliated%20by%20annihilating%20the%20Iretis%27%20citizenry","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Ashiok","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ashiok#:~:text=The%20leonin%20retaliated%20by%20annihilating%20the%20Iretis%27%20citizenry","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Ashiok\", section \"Theros\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"kedarick-vi-e2","summary":"At the treaty signing, nightmare creatures appear and kill leonin el